      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have a question about this change. Since each hash table (for a particular block size) has 2^16 \u003d 65536 buckets, if more than 256 intrabc block candidates are hashed to the same bucket, doesn\u0027t that indicate the hash function is malfunctioning?",
      "revId": "22391fed536d74a47ee0effcd2636efcd2764f6b",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
